OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CBros announce first tour in a decade   
OL,5,GThe band Bros have announced their     
OL,6,Gfirst tour in a decade.                
OL,8,FFormed in Camberley, Surrey, in 1986   
OL,9,Fby twin brothers Matt and Luke Goss    
OL,10,Falongside Craig Logan, the band had    
OL,11,Fhits including When Will I Be Famous?, 
OL,12,FDrop The Boy and I Owe You Nothing.    
OL,14,FLogan left in 1989 and Bros split      
OL,15,Fthree years later, although Matt and   
OL,16,FLuke Goss reunited in 2017 and have    
OL,17,Fnot toured together since.             
